Package: com.thr0wback.booter
Name: Thr0wback
Version: 0.1.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Boot an older iOS as a second OS on a jailbroken 32-bit iPhone (experimental)
 Phone-only CoolBooter-style loader. Uses kloader to boot a prepared second-OS
 bootchain from the running jailbroken iOS. For hardware you own, with your own
 firmware. Experimental: iOS 4.0 is the realistic target on iPhone 4; iOS 3 is a
 moonshot that may not boot.
Maintainer: Thr0wback
Author: Thr0wback
Section: System
Depends: firmware (>= 4.0)
Homepage: https://github.com/Omar-coderlegacyiphone/thr0wback
